[[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3025836\">7040L40</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025879\">7050A22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025827\">7040H42</a> (left\nand right sides)</p><p><a href=\"#/3025932\">7065C30</a> (rear)</p><p>1. Slightly lower the ceiling trim (1a) and undo the hinge bolts\n(1b).</p><p>2. Remove the hinges.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2005195.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the hinges are undamaged.</p><p>Fit the hinges and screw in the bolts without\ntightening them.</p><p>With tailgate fitted <a href=\"#/3025735\">7015A14</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025932\">7065C30</a> (rear)</p><p><a href=\"#/3025827\">7040H42</a> (left\nand right sides)</p><p><a href=\"#/3025879\">7050A22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025836\">7040L40</a></p>"]]